-05-Colours.png", "id": "2230592174188104", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620559_2230592177521437_9194446062713125446_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tWkZFufw1vwQ7kNvwEyanHU&_nc_oc=AdrbgmJDBvPgn3t9RVxACsiB5vzdxSixFWHwEVLojSDe3bCQ9h6ouzMRTlC4YlX8xKA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMNvcXvklsKMujd1fwbxKb0gjpYCgZijo246D02lkdbkg&oe=6ADF7B69"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot-Library-Two-Demos.png", "id": "2220036632243349", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595129854_2220036635576682_3308972694544751695_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O9y1rbaWpGYQ7kNvwFXPcCs&_nc_oc=AdpShpXLn2z4y52l-CeiYofl5yXWLhrff9OwFFPX7AcD2XoEsugyKYulWMw8gjERcuE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNuaL-2PcZ6YrqvH38sclAz7z1rDtcKOEq8OWkF7ZKkOA&oe=6ADF6BDC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer-Cover-Original.png", "id": "1688011389344782", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654975915_1688011396011448_6475998226123403518_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=meALEJDVRj8Q7kNvwHNU2EW&_nc_oc=AdouSHeMK55iiOhvzXvwkCY0VgvYtp3IR43PfbcxxCwVSUddafASFtqMM2jMeeDyUQw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMC77QsBpBGZxrUgTEaeayXdzPZc8pioWxH9ew4BEQs4g&oe=6ADF49EC"}, "display_name": "Visual Music player", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Rediscover your favourite music in VR. Play local MP3 or FLAC files and follow a moving arrow, colourful 3D trail and glowing ball as they respond to the song. Enjoy melodies, rhythm and musical highs and lows in a refreshing, satisfying experience.\n\nBRING YOUR MUSIC\nOpen a music file, add a folder or scan your headset with your permission. Original audio starts while on-device analysis prepares the movement. The same arrow follows prominent singing and instruments; results vary with each recording.\n\nWATCH AND FEEL\nOptional Show surroundings places the visuals in your real room. Feel the music adds controller haptics: rhythmic impacts and subtle musical waves. Adjust their strength or turn them off.\n\nMAKE IT YOURS\nChoose colours and sizes for the arrow, trail, ball and tiles. Arrange the surface as a floor or wall; move, rotate and resize objects together or separately. Save named views. Changes apply while music plays.\n\nKEEP LISTENING\nSearch with the Quest keyboard, sort songs and create playlists. Add multiple songs, use shuffle/repeat, volume and seek jumps, or change speed from 0.5x to 2x; speed changes tempo and pitch.\n\nStart with the licensed Saltarello or Through Fire violin/flute demos. Credits are in Settings. Music, playlists and analysis stay on your headset. No PC or separate app login is needed during use. Meta verifies Store ownership.", "short_description": "Play your own MP3 or FLAC music and see it come alive in VR. Follow a moving arrow and colourful 3D trail while a glowing ball lights a tiled floor or wall. Add gentle controller haptics or show your real surroundings. Enjoy musical highs and lows in a refreshing, satisfying way, with included demos, playlists, live colours and saved views."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://visual-music-player-privacy.ravora-healt-0777.chatgpt.site/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Krishna jeya kumar", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://visual-music-player-privacy.ravora-healt-0777.chatgpt.site/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1351478091386773"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2310621119750932"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2310621119750932"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1792098960, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2310621119750932"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1378260172041898", "version": "2.1.0"}, "id": "2167794850820199", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1351478084720107", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1378260172041898"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2167794850820199"}]}, "change_log": "\"Explore ten music-reactive surroundings, including Rainbow Bars, spectra and reflective scenes. Enjoy clearer 3D arrow trails, optional complementary instrument motion, and an updated Rainbow Bars starting look. Open or close the menu with the left controller Menu button. Avatar visuals have been removed. Includes the Android controller-lifecycle crash fix.\"", "created_date": 1792487313, "id": "1378260172041898", "version": "2.1.0", "version_code": 26, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1351478084720107", "is_con